            <div xml:id="d1374">

                <pb facs="1300" n="1134" sameAs="frus:frus1917/pg1134"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 817.51/990</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Minister Jefferson to the Secretary of State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Legation</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Managua</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1917-08-08T10:00:00-05:45">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">August 8, 1917, 10 a.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Department’s July 31, 7 p.m. The Finance Committee of Nicaraguan Congress will
                    report to Congress to-day for its consideration plan of Department in the form
                    of decree.</p>
                <p>Article one of the decree authorizes the Executive to change such contracts as
                    may be necessary with the bankers and foreign bondholders in conformity with
                    basis of plan.</p>
                <p>Chamorro informed me that he would appoint as the representative of the
                    Nicaraguan Government Ramón Enríquez, Acting Consul at New Orleans, who will
                    proceed to Washington within a few days for the purpose of participating in the
                    execution of a formal contract between the interested parties.</p>
                <p>Immediately after the final passage of the plan by the Congress I shall report
                    fully as to its status.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Jefferson</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
